    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Iconic Super Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: Bulletproof Glass, Communications Center, Deployable Spike Strip [x2], TUp (Groundcar Compatible) Enhanced Interface Plug Integration, Improved Engine, Light Armored Chassis, NOS [x3], Reinforced Tires, TUp (Hardwired Locks) Security Upgrade (Advanced). Also: TUp (Improved) Racing Tires. No Heavy Chassis or Seating Upgrade. Racing tires: +2 to Maneuvers on pavement. Plugged in, a Maneuver takes only your Action. Without REF 8+ or active Speedware, −8 to Drive Land Vehicle. Miss a Drive Land Vehicle Check by 5 or less and its guidance computer rerolls it at Skill Base 14. In a chase (Hot Pursuit), once per chase make a DV15 Positioning Check to jump 2 squares ahead.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> Super Luxury • Legends can’t be bought, choomba. (Cannot be fabricated. Must be gifted or scavenged)<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 10<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 50<br><strong>SP:</strong> 10<br><strong>Seats:</strong> 2<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 70<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 350 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
